msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:6
msgid ""
"Install the base Xinference package with ``pip`` on Linux, Windows, or "
"macOS::"
msgstr ""
"Installieren Sie das Xinference-Basispaket mit ``pip`` unter Linux, Windows "
